/mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" movablelimits=\"true\">gcd</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch06-polynomials/02-ideals-and-gcd.html"}